WEBVTT

c1
00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:01.580
Hello, friends!

c2
00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:03.525
I am Dot.

c3
00:00:03.675 --> 00:00:04.685
I will jump

c4
00:00:04.685 --> 00:00:06.505
over the log.

c5
00:00:07.217 --> 00:00:08.887
Oops! I fell.

c6
00:00:08.887 --> 00:00:10.767
That is okay.

c7
00:00:10.917 --> 00:00:12.487
I try again,

c8
00:00:12.487 --> 00:00:13.347
and again.

c9
00:00:14.437 --> 00:00:15.447
Hooray! I

c10
00:00:15.447 --> 00:00:16.247
did it!

c11
00:00:17.132 --> 00:00:18.732
Trying again helps

c12
00:00:18.732 --> 00:00:19.652
me grow.

c13
00:00:20.557 --> 00:00:21.197
Let us

c14
00:00:21.197 --> 00:00:22.397
try together!
